@startuml breadpan-menu
participant 消费方
participant breadpan
participant "Item（dbusmenu）" as item

消费方 -> breadpan: 入口
note right of breadpan
  right_click / left_click(menu_only) 路由命中（§2.7）；
  或 menu() / menu_expand()
  （弹窗打开期间 MenuChanged 重取）
end note
breadpan -> item: AboutToShow(parent)
note right of item
  常规前置：告知弹出在即，
  触发 Item 惰性构建 / 刷新
end note
item --> breadpan: 需要更新?
breadpan -> item: GetLayout(parent, 1 层)
note right of item
  懒加载：每次一层
  （recursionDepth = 1）
end note
breadpan -> item: GetGroupProperties
item --> breadpan: 布局 + 属性
breadpan -> breadpan: == 组装该层快照（助记符解析 + raw 逃生门）==
breadpan --> 消费方: Outcome::Menu
note over 消费方
  子层展开 → menu_expand(id, entry_id)，
  深层按需逐层加载
end note
note over breadpan
  Item 侧 LayoutUpdated / ItemsPropertiesUpdated →
  仅转发 MenuChanged 事件，是否重取由消费方决定
end note
@enduml
